<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" agent="DeepFake-AI Antigravity" version="24.0.0" type="device"><diagram id="diag_ST2SyncNetArchitecture" name="ST2SyncNetArchitecture"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1380" pageHeight="920" background="#0a0f1d" math="1" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" /><mxCell id="node_2" value="&lt;b&gt;Video Frame Input&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style='color:#94a3b8;'&gt;RGB Face Crop&lt;/i&gt;&lt;hr style='border-color:#1e293b;'&gt;• Resolution: 3 x 224 x 224&lt;br&gt;• Normalized (μ=0.485, σ=0.229)&lt;br&gt;• Face Landmark Centered&lt;br&gt;• Batch Dimension: B&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='color:#38bdf8;font-weight:bold;'&gt;[[B, 3, 224, 224]]&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#141e33;strokeColor=#38bdf8;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="140" width="230" height="180" /></mxCell><mxCell id="node_3" value="&lt;b&gt;Haar Wavelet DWT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style='color:#94a3b8;'&gt;2D Discrete Wavelet&lt;/i&gt;&lt;hr style='border-color:#1e293b;'&gt;• Haar Wavelet Kernels:&lt;br&gt;    LL (Low-Pass Filter)&lt;br&gt;    LH (Horizontal Edges)&lt;br&gt;    HL (Vertical Edges)&lt;br&gt;    HH (Diagonal High-Freq)&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='color:#818cf8;font-weight:bold;'&gt;[[B, 12, 112, 112]]&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#141e33;strokeColor=#818cf8;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="400" width="230" height="180" /></mxCell><mxCell id="node_4" value="&lt;b&gt;Temporal Frame Sequence&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style='color:#94a3b8;'&gt;Sliding Time Window&lt;/i&gt;&lt;hr style='border-color:#1e293b;'&gt;• T = 16 Consecutive Frames&lt;br&gt;• Eye Aspect Ratio (EAR) Buffer&lt;br&gt;• Lip Boundary Contour Sequence&lt;br&gt;• Inter-Frame Motion Flow&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='color:#f59e0b;font-weight:bold;'&gt;[[B, 16, 3, 224, 224]]&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#141e33;strokeColor=#f59e0b;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="660" width="230" height="180" /></mxCell><mxCell id="node_5" value="&lt;b&gt;Spatial Boundary Attention (SBAM)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style='color:#94a3b8;'&gt;Facial Seam &amp;amp; Contour Extraction&lt;/i&gt;&lt;hr style='border-color:#1e293b;'&gt;• Stem: Conv2d(3→32, k=3, s=2) + BatchNorm + ReLU&lt;br&gt;• Conv2d(32→64, k=3) + MaxPool(2)&lt;br&gt;• Residual Block: Conv2d(64→64, k=3) x 2 with Skip&lt;br&gt;• Head: Conv2d(64→128, k=3, s=2) + AdaptiveAvgPool(4x4)&lt;br&gt;• FC Layer: Linear(128*4*4 → 128)&lt;br&gt;• Output: f_spatial ∈ R^128&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='color:#06b6d4;font-weight:bold;'&gt;[f_spatial ∈ R^128]&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#141e33;strokeColor=#06b6d4;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="310" y="140" width="340" height="220" /></mxCell><mxCell id="node_6" value="&lt;b&gt;Spectral Phase Coherence (PCM)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style='color:#94a3b8;'&gt;Wavelet Subband Discrepancy&lt;/i&gt;&lt;hr style='border-color:#1e293b;'&gt;• Input: 12-Channel Wavelet Subbands (LL, LH, HL, HH)&lt;br&gt;• Conv2d(12→64, k=3, p=1) + BatchNorm + SiLU&lt;br&gt;• Conv2d(64→128, k=3, s=2, p=1) + BatchNorm + SiLU&lt;br&gt;• AdaptiveAvgPool2d(4, 4)&lt;br&gt;• FC Layer: Linear(128*4*4 → 128)&lt;br&gt;• Output: f_spectral ∈ R^128&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='color:#818cf8;font-weight:bold;'&gt;[f_spectral ∈ R^128]&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#141e33;strokeColor=#818cf8;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="310" y="400" width="340" height="220" /></mxCell><mxCell id="node_7" value="&lt;b&gt;Temporal Biological Consistency&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style='color:#94a3b8;'&gt;Kinematics &amp;amp; Micro-Expression Dynamics&lt;/i&gt;&lt;hr style='border-color:#1e293b;'&gt;• Input: Spatial Features Across 16 Frames&lt;br&gt;• Bidirectional GRU (input=128, hidden=128, layers=1)&lt;br&gt;• GRU Output Concatenation: 256-dim&lt;br&gt;• Linear Projection: Linear(256 → 128)&lt;br&gt;• Output: f_temporal ∈ R^128&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='color:#f59e0b;font-weight:bold;'&gt;[f_temporal ∈ R^128]&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#141e33;strokeColor=#f59e0b;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="310" y="660" width="340" height="200" /></mxCell><mxCell id="node_8" value="&lt;b&gt;Multi-Head Cross-Attention&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style='color:#94a3b8;'&gt;Spatial Queries Attend to Spectral Keys&lt;/i&gt;&lt;hr style='border-color:#1e293b;'&gt;• Query: Q = f_spatial ∈ R^(1 x B x 128)&lt;br&gt;• Key, Value: K, V = [f_spatial, f_spectral] ∈ R^(2 x B x 128)&lt;br&gt;• Attention Head Computation (num_heads=4):&lt;br&gt;    Head_i = Softmax( Q_i K_i^T / √d_k ) V_i&lt;br&gt;• MultiHead(Q,K,V) = Concat(Head_1..4) W^O&lt;br&gt;• Residual Skip Addition: f_spatial + Attn&lt;br&gt;• LayerNorm Normalization (dim=128)&lt;br&gt;• Output: f_fused ∈ R^128&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='color:#c084fc;font-weight:bold;'&gt;[f_fused ∈ R^128]&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#141e33;strokeColor=#c084fc;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="690" y="200" width="320" height="280" /></mxCell><mxCell id="node_9" value="&lt;b&gt;Feature Fusion &amp;amp; Concatenation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style='color:#94a3b8;'&gt;Multi-Domain Joint Embedding&lt;/i&gt;&lt;hr style='border-color:#1e293b;'&gt;• Multi-Modal Vector Concatenation:&lt;br&gt;    f_combined = Concat(f_fused, f_temporal) ∈ R^256&lt;br&gt;• If Temporal Input Absent:&lt;br&gt;    f_combined = Concat(f_fused, f_spectral) ∈ R^256&lt;br&gt;• Dropout Regularization (p = 0.40)&lt;br&gt;• Feed-Forward Expansion Layer: Linear(256 → 64)&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='color:#38bdf8;font-weight:bold;'&gt;[f_combined ∈ R^256]&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#141e33;strokeColor=#38bdf8;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="690" y="560" width="320" height="240" /></mxCell><mxCell id="node_10" value="&lt;b&gt;Forensic Classifier Head&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style='color:#94a3b8;'&gt;Primary Binary Decision&lt;/i&gt;&lt;hr style='border-color:#1e293b;'&gt;• Linear(256 → 64) + ReLU&lt;br&gt;• Dropout(p=0.40)&lt;br&gt;• Linear(64 → 2) (Logits: Real vs Fake)&lt;br&gt;• Loss: Cross-Entropy (L_ce)&lt;br&gt;• Evaluation AUC: 0.9995 (Best Checkpoint)&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='color:#34d399;font-weight:bold;'&gt;[P(Real), P(Fake)]&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#062e1e;strokeColor=#34d399;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1050" y="140" width="290" height="220" /></mxCell><mxCell id="node_11" value="&lt;b&gt;Auxiliary Boundary Head&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style='color:#94a3b8;'&gt;Blending Discontinuity Loss&lt;/i&gt;&lt;hr style='border-color:#1e293b;'&gt;• Input: f_spatial ∈ R^128&lt;br&gt;• Linear Layer: Linear(128 → 1)&lt;br&gt;• Predicts Ground-Truth Boundary Mask IoU&lt;br&gt;• Auxiliary Loss: L_boundary (Weight = 0.3)&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='color:#06b6d4;font-weight:bold;'&gt;[L_boundary Loss]&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#141e33;strokeColor=#06b6d4;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1050" y="400" width="290" height="200" /></mxCell><mxCell id="node_12" value="&lt;b&gt;Auxiliary Spectral Head&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style='color:#94a3b8;'&gt;Frequency Anomaly Loss&lt;/i&gt;&lt;hr style='border-color:#1e293b;'&gt;• Input: f_spectral ∈ R^128&lt;br&gt;• Linear Layer: Linear(128 → 1)&lt;br&gt;• Predicts 1/f² Deviation Magnitude&lt;br&gt;• Auxiliary Loss: L_spectral (Weight = 0.3)&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='color:#a855f7;font-weight:bold;'&gt;[L_spectral Loss]&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#141e33;strokeColor=#a855f7;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1050" y="640" width="290" height="200" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge_13" value="DWT Decomposition" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#818cf8;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#818cf8;fontSize=10;" edge="1" parent="1" source="node_2" target="node_3"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge_14" value="Query (Spatial)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#06b6d4;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#06b6d4;fontSize=10;" edge="1" parent="1" source="node_5" target="node_8"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge_15" value="Keys/Vals (Spectral)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#818cf8;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#818cf8;fontSize=10;" edge="1" parent="1" source="node_6" target="node_8"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge_16" value="f_fused" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#c084fc;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#c084fc;fontSize=10;" edge="1" parent="1" source="node_8" target="node_9"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge_17" value="f_temporal" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#f59e0b;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#f59e0b;fontSize=10;" edge="1" parent="1" source="node_7" target="node_9"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge_18" value="f_combined" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#34d399;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#34d399;fontSize=10;" edge="1" parent="1" source="node_9" target="node_10"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge_19" value="f_spatial" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#06b6d4;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#06b6d4;fontSize=10;" edge="1" parent="1" source="node_5" target="node_11"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge_20" value="f_spectral" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#a855f7;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#a855f7;fontSize=10;" edge="1" parent="1" source="node_6" target="node_12"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>